<title>USA: Dollar well-bid vs yen in Tokyo on Nikkei, JGBs.</title>
<headline>Dollar well-bid vs yen in Tokyo on Nikkei, JGBs.</headline>
<text>
<p>0502 GMT -- *Dollar well-bid against yen by mid-afternoon Tokyo on weakness in Nikkei and falls in JGB yields. *But offers by Japanese exporters and U.S. fund operators capped dollar near 119 yen. *Concerns that Japanese monetary officials may try to talk down dollar limited aggressive buying.</p>
</text>
